<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">GROWING TOGETHER</view><view class="title">{{title}}</view><view class="sub">{{pending ? '请明确选择本次填报的孩子，或建立新档案。' : '查看生长记录、医护建议和随访安排。'}}</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在读取健康档案…</view><view wx:elif="{{!children.length}}" class="empty">还没有患儿档案，请先建档。</view><view wx:for="{{children}}" wx:key="id" class="card row" bindtap="choose" data-id="{{item.id}}"><view class="avatar">禾</view><view class="grow"><view class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:8rpx">{{item.name}}</view><view class="small">{{item.sex}} · {{item.birth}}出生</view></view><text class="link">{{pending ? '填写 →' : '查看 →'}}</text></view><button class="primary" bindtap="create">＋ 建立患儿档案</button><button class="plain" bindtap="logout">退出当前账号</button></view>
